  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Strengthening Project 2016-2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project is designed to continue with the capacity strengthening of Caritas Sierra Leone, using the 2013 Road-Map. The project is borne out of the commitment by the Bishop&#x2019;s Conference of Sierra Leone, the National Advisory Board, and with support from the Catholic Development Agencies (CDA) partner&#x2019;

The project will prioritize four (4) out of the seven (7) Road-Map pillars, namely to:
(a)	Establish mechanisms to improve Coordination 
(b)	Harmonization of key management policies 
(c)	Staff training / accompaniment
(d)	Establish mechanism financial sustainability of the National Office</narrative>
  </description>
